WEBVTT

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:52.090
Shin-chan.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.510
Kiri-chan, what are you...

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.800
Surprised to find both
me and Hiroki here?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.110
Uh, yeah...

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.800
I thought about calling you,
but it's been so long.

00:02:06.800 --> 00:02:09.210
I thought it might be
fun to surprise you!

00:02:10.810 --> 00:02:13.950
I knew you had become
a teacher, Kiri-chan.

00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:15.610
Hiroki...

00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:19.420
I bet you can't believe Hiroki's becoming
an art teacher, either!

00:02:19.840 --> 00:02:23.020
He's becoming an art teacher?

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.410
Well, there you have it.

00:02:26.410 --> 00:02:30.640
Yanagi, what are you doing in
that expensive looking coat?

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.430
What?

00:02:31.930 --> 00:02:34.270
Are you rich? Buy me dinner sometime!

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.470
You're unbelievable!

00:02:36.470 --> 00:02:38.880
You two haven't changed.

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:41.390
You can tell us we've grown old.

00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:42.910
Kiri needs to hear it.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:44.610
What's that supposed to mean?

00:02:44.610 --> 00:02:47.380
You'll get wrinkles if you get angry.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.960
I've got to get going.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.350
Elis will give me an earful.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:57.760
Elis-chan? That girl who was always
following you around?

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:59.940
She's attending Nadesico.

00:02:59.940 --> 00:03:00.910
Really.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:03.400
Yanagi, you're coming
to the art club, right?

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:06.110
Yes. I thought I'd stop by tomorrow.

00:03:06.110 --> 00:03:07.430
See you then!

00:03:13.560 --> 00:03:17.100
He's becoming a teacher?
What about painting?

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.880
Oh, right.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.780
It seems that's on hold for now.

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:22.710
I see.

00:03:23.620 --> 00:03:27.250
But he hasn't given up
on being an artist.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.550
He just has a new goal of
becoming a teacher.

00:03:29.550 --> 00:03:30.390
What?

00:03:30.660 --> 00:03:32.810
He's pretty good at it.

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:38.000
The students all have faith in
him. Unbelievable, isn't it?

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.900
Sorry. Have I said too much?

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:42.570
No...

00:03:42.570 --> 00:03:46.140
I can see you two are still quite close.

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:50.330
Huh? It's nothing like that!

00:04:01.120 --> 00:04:03.020
Hey, Onii-chan!

00:04:03.020 --> 00:04:06.840
What? I'm not washing
your underwear now.

00:04:06.840 --> 00:04:08.130
That's not it.

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:11.030
I heard Yanagi Shinichiro
is coming to Nadesico!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:13.360
How do you know about that?

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:18.420
I just got a text from
President Takeuchi.

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:20.250
Oh, right.

00:04:20.250 --> 00:04:23.370
I saw someone who looked
like him on my way home.

00:04:23.840 --> 00:04:26.220
You remember what he looks like?

00:04:26.220 --> 00:04:29.240
Kind of.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.900
He's got the look of the
culprit on a TV special!

00:04:31.900 --> 00:04:33.380
That's a little harsh.

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:35.890
What? It's not harsh at all.

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:38.120
I meant he looks harmless and kind.

00:04:38.490 --> 00:04:41.870
Aren't those people always the
most suspicious on TV shows?

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:43.830
Give it a rest.

00:04:45.060 --> 00:04:47.270
Good morning, everyone.

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.250
Good morning.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.270
This fall's special guest lecturer...

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:56.840
is the much anticipated up and coming
artist Yanagi Shinichiro.

00:04:56.840 --> 00:04:59.580
Please welcome him with
a round of applause.

00:05:10.010 --> 00:05:12.620
Nice to meet you. I am
Yanagi Shinichiro.

00:05:13.340 --> 00:05:15.750
When I was a student like all of you...

00:05:14.550 --> 00:05:16.850
Something's in the air.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:18.940
I always had my friends by my side.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:24.630
My friends taught me something I couldn't
learn from skill or knowledge.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:26.290
Elis-chan? What are you looking at?

00:05:24.630 --> 00:05:27.670
Expression and feeling come
not only from class...

00:05:26.290 --> 00:05:27.670
Huh? Right...

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.220
He's Kamikura-sensei's friend?

00:05:34.220 --> 00:05:37.690
What's it like knowing a celebrity?

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.550
It doesn't seem like a good thing.

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.760
Something's definitely fishy!

00:05:45.770 --> 00:05:47.310
You think so?

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:49.730
She was just his model.

00:05:49.730 --> 00:05:53.950
Yeah. What you're saying is
an affront to the art world!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:57.120
What? But don't you think...

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:58.090
Senpai.

00:05:58.090 --> 00:06:00.400
Oh, good timing.

00:06:00.800 --> 00:06:02.270
Take a look at this!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.080
Kiri-sensei?

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:10.080
Don't you think this is overflowing
with love?

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.890
This is serious.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:13.400
But that's...

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:17.090
No, you'd never paint this
way without love.

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:20.010
But if that's true, Kamikura-sensei...

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.360
I agree with Takeuchi-senpai.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:32.800
You can't paint without love.

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:36.070
You really think so?

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:39.130
I'm a sucker for that kind of thing, so...

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:42.280
Wouldn't we have heard more
rumors about you, then?

00:06:42.280 --> 00:06:43.560
Shut up!

00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:48.340
You just don't know the crazy
things I've been up to.

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:50.550
That's news to me.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:54.230
Well, you don't know the crazy
things I've been up to.

00:06:54.230 --> 00:06:55.490
What? What are you talking about?

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.200
Tell me, tell me.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:03.800
Why?

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:06.260
All you have are sweets.

00:07:06.930 --> 00:07:09.460
I couldn't be bothered to decide...

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:11.640
and this is what I ended up with
when I chose at random.

00:07:11.640 --> 00:07:13.180
I see.

00:07:13.180 --> 00:07:17.430
Hiroki, why are you eating
nothing but sweets?

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:19.580
Could I sit here?

00:07:22.160 --> 00:07:23.350
Sure...

00:07:25.160 --> 00:07:26.780
Do you mind?

00:07:26.780 --> 00:07:28.270
Go ahead.

00:07:30.230 --> 00:07:33.160
Is that you, Elis-chan?

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:34.870
Yes.

00:07:34.870 --> 00:07:36.970
You've grown.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.280
And you've become quite beautiful.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:40.740
You must be popular.

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:47.380
Hiroki, are you free tonight?

00:07:48.650 --> 00:07:54.170
We were thinking about getting together
to celebrate our reunion.

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.990
But I'm...

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:57.050
Are you busy?

00:07:57.310 --> 00:07:58.860
Uh, no.

00:08:01.840 --> 00:08:05.630
I guess it wouldn't hurt to
drink once in a while.

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:08.350
Would you like to come too, Elis-chan?

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.580
You'll be having juice instead
of drinks, though.

00:08:16.070 --> 00:08:19.480
Yanagi-sensei, what do you think of this?

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:23.920
I was thinking I should give it
a more wizened appearance.

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:25.860
Yeah, for this you could...

00:08:25.860 --> 00:08:28.130
Sensei, come see mine, too!

00:08:28.130 --> 00:08:29.020
One at a time...

00:08:29.020 --> 00:08:32.530
Sensei, look at mine next!

00:08:32.530 --> 00:08:34.190
Sure...

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:36.400
Thank you.

00:08:36.400 --> 00:08:40.030
Pay more attention to the shadows
on the right and left sides.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.670
You should be able to tell
it's darker on this side.

00:08:44.020 --> 00:08:46.020
Yes, thank you.

00:08:47.520 --> 00:08:49.600
We're running out of charcoal.

00:08:49.600 --> 00:08:51.040
I'll get some more.

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:56.450
Hiroki...

00:08:58.640 --> 00:09:00.380
Just as I thought.

00:09:00.920 --> 00:09:04.110
The atmosphere and strokes...

00:09:04.110 --> 00:09:06.300
They're very reminiscent
of Hiroki's work.

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.150
Hosen-san's lucky.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:09.830
No fair.

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.660
Let's see...

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.180
Why don't you try adding
a green accent here?

00:09:15.180 --> 00:09:17.540
It'll give your painting more depth.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:26.100
Onii-chan said I should try
using ultramarine here...

00:09:27.550 --> 00:09:29.980
I think it's a good idea, too.

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:33.450
Hosen-san...

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:36.250
I'm so sorry.

00:09:36.250 --> 00:09:38.430
She doesn't mean any harm.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.970
She says things without thinking.

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:43.460
That's not true.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:46.920
You're right. Ultramarine
could work, too.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:47.700
Yes.

00:09:56.660 --> 00:09:58.580
He's got the face of a criminal!

00:09:58.580 --> 00:10:01.340
He's always so kind...

00:10:01.340 --> 00:10:03.960
but behind those glasses, his
eyes are never smiling!

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:07.230
What's your problem with Yanagi?

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:08.590
I don't have a problem with him.

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:13.220
I'm just telling you what I saw.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:15.360
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.160
Oh, no!

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.820
I forgot a gift!

00:10:20.820 --> 00:10:22.710
But we're already here!

00:10:22.710 --> 00:10:25.480
Kiri will never let me hear the end
of it if I don't bring something.

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:27.620
You go on ahead.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:29.370
I'll go with you!

00:10:29.370 --> 00:10:33.510
It's fine. Tell them to start without me.

00:10:33.510 --> 00:10:34.280
See you later!

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:35.530
Hey, wait...

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:40.330
Onii-chan.

00:10:56.640 --> 00:10:58.100
What's taking Hiroki so long?

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:05.610
You don't have to wait for Onii-chan.

00:11:05.610 --> 00:11:07.490
He said to start without him.

00:11:07.490 --> 00:11:10.460
No, it's a special occasion. We'll wait.

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.820
This brings back memories.

00:11:13.950 --> 00:11:17.600
Hiroki never showed up
to the reunion either.

00:11:17.600 --> 00:11:20.420
Some of the guys tried
to eat Hiroki's food...

00:11:20.420 --> 00:11:21.590
but you stopped them.

00:11:23.270 --> 00:11:26.330
Oh, right. Is that what happened?

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:37.290
Yanagi-san, what were you feeling
when you painted Kiri-sensei?

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:42.070
Everyone's talking about whether you
painted her simply as a model...

00:11:42.070 --> 00:11:43.890
or as the subject of your affection.

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:45.150
Elis-chan?

00:11:57.560 --> 00:12:01.050
Did you like the painting of
Kiri-chan I submitted...

00:12:01.600 --> 00:12:02.970
to the Amateur Art Show?

00:12:03.970 --> 00:12:05.770
Huh? Of course.

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:07.640
It's a beautiful painting...

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:11.840
Hiroki was supposed to paint it.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.560
Onii-chan?

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:16.510
Wait, Shin-chan.

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:19.640
I don't understand. What do you...

00:12:20.560 --> 00:12:25.790
Hiroki had finished his sketch of
the same drawing before me.

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.590
I stole his composition.

00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:48.050
Onii-chan...

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:51.750
You stole it?

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:53.590
You mean you just copied
him, don't you?

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:58.060
Among artists, copying another's
composition is unforgivable...

00:12:58.620 --> 00:12:59.990
but Hiroki...

00:13:01.060 --> 00:13:06.630
Hiroki gave me his precious
composition.

00:13:19.420 --> 00:13:20.330
Hello?

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.180
It's me, Hiroki.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:24.880
Sorry, something urgent came up...

00:13:25.100 --> 00:13:26.820
I see.

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:28.780
Oh, uh...

00:13:28.780 --> 00:13:34.420
I've got a lot to take care of,
so I can't make it tonight.

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:37.470
I understand. Bye.

00:13:38.400 --> 00:13:40.820
What did Hiroki say?

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.520
Something came up.

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:44.370
I see.

00:13:45.410 --> 00:13:47.540
He doesn't want to see you, Yanagi-san.

00:13:47.540 --> 00:13:49.470
Elis-chan!

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.110
It's fine.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.780
Hiroki hasn't forgiven me.

00:13:58.450 --> 00:14:00.450
I'm going home!

00:14:00.450 --> 00:14:01.050
Elis-chan.

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:03.220
I'll walk you home. It's not safe at night.

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:06.120
I'll be fine. Good bye.

00:14:13.020 --> 00:14:15.770
He doesn't like me, does he?

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:21.060
I'm the one he should hate.

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:27.030
I refused to accept Hiroki
was becoming a teacher.

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:30.980
I asked him why he stopped painting.

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:32.590
Kiri-chan...

00:14:42.020 --> 00:14:45.430
I never stopped to think how Hiroki felt.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:50.130
I forced my feelings on him. I...

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:53.670
Hiroki, I'm sorry...

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:03.750
Onii-chan?

00:15:07.730 --> 00:15:08.910
Elis...

00:15:08.910 --> 00:15:10.860
I thought you had something to do.

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.790
It didn't take as long as I expected.

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:15.730
Liar.

00:15:16.950 --> 00:15:20.230
You've been telling nothing
but lies lately.

00:15:20.230 --> 00:15:22.750
I won't forgive you for lying to me...

00:15:23.600 --> 00:15:25.740
but you've also been lying to yourself.

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.040
What are you talking about?

00:15:28.520 --> 00:15:32.130
Having your work stolen is nothing!

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:37.000
You stopped painting after having
just one composition stolen.

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.820
Is that all painting is to you?

00:15:44.070 --> 00:15:47.220
Is it something you can give up so easily?

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:53.260
Answer me, Kamikura Hiroki!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:18.790
Onii-chan wanted to enter
the Amateur Art Show...

00:16:18.790 --> 00:16:20.770
with Kiri-san's painting...

00:16:32.670 --> 00:16:35.920
Good morning, Kikyo-sensei.

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.710
Sorry about yesterday.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:43.290
What's wrong?

00:16:44.040 --> 00:16:46.680
Don't worry about me.

00:16:46.680 --> 00:16:49.770
I'm a little disappointed
about the paella.

00:16:51.390 --> 00:16:54.230
It was delicious.

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:56.530
I usually screw it up.

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.670
Well, see you later.

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:58.630
Hey, wait.

00:17:12.530 --> 00:17:13.720
Working hard?

00:17:14.540 --> 00:17:17.040
What are you doing here?

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:19.300
Didn't you already give your lecture?

00:17:19.300 --> 00:17:20.120
Yes.

00:17:26.210 --> 00:17:30.930
If that painting hadn't won, I
wouldn't be standing here.

00:17:31.550 --> 00:17:33.340
If not for your composition...

00:17:33.340 --> 00:17:35.220
That's not true.

00:17:35.220 --> 00:17:39.350
There's more to a painting than
just the composition...

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:42.370
If you had painted it, it would have
been even more spectacular.

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:48.880
Because you and Kiri-chan...

00:17:54.090 --> 00:17:57.820
I can't pretend you'll forgive me.

00:18:02.790 --> 00:18:04.040
But...

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:09.800
I'd like to see you paint again.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:14.240
Well...

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:19.490
Good bye, Hiroki.

00:19:00.570 --> 00:19:01.540
Yanagi!

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:04.610
Hiroki...

00:19:06.940 --> 00:19:10.930
It's not your fault I quit painting!

00:19:10.930 --> 00:19:12.270
What?

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:13.360
Hiroki, you...

00:19:18.500 --> 00:19:20.800
Come back sometime! We'll
go for drinks then!

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.030
All right.

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:28.990
Later, Yanagi!

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:30.480
We'll meet again!

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:52.840
Art Room

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:03.020
Kiri-chan.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.480
I saw you from the faculty office.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:07.250
I see.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:11.800
Thank you for telling me about Hiroki.

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:12.420
Not at all.

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:16.170
I thought a lot last night.

00:20:18.580 --> 00:20:22.430
Hiroki is the only one who
knows how he is feeling...

00:20:22.430 --> 00:20:26.510
but if he knew you blamed yourself...

00:20:27.090 --> 00:20:29.770
I think he would feel
even worse about it.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.070
Kiri-chan...

00:20:35.130 --> 00:20:38.880
Shin-chan, you're making your way in the
art world on your own talents now.

00:20:38.880 --> 00:20:40.830
I wish you would have more
confidence in yourself.

00:20:40.830 --> 00:20:43.800
I'm sure it would make
Hiroki happy, too.

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.230
Hiroki, huh?

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:47.150
What?

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.540
Nothing.

00:20:48.540 --> 00:20:49.160
Thank you.

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:51.460
Let's go out for drinks sometime, okay?

00:20:51.870 --> 00:20:53.110
Just the two of us?

00:20:53.110 --> 00:20:55.000
Or the three of us?

00:20:55.300 --> 00:20:58.300
The three of us friends, of course.

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:00.850
I'll call you.

00:23:10.770 --> 00:23:15.110
Indigo is darker than blue and
lighter than mazarine.

00:23:15.110 --> 00:23:19.340
What it lacks in grandeur it makes
up for with hidden strength.

00:23:19.840 --> 00:23:21.220
Hey, Hiroki...

00:23:21.220 --> 00:23:24.610
Why do men fall for older women?

00:23:24.610 --> 00:23:29.490
